{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02892","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 二 · 胡元范","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金闺未息火，玉树锺天爱。\n月路饰还装，星津动归佩。\n紫极流宸渥，清规伫慈诲。\n恩波洽九流，光辉轶千载。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡元范","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}